        ":question/problem": "![](images/58/5838af36cb81a941ddbbed58939640f1941bde8589c5e474cbfff1d22a3a6d80.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $T$ lies on the segment $LZ$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{OL}=a$ and $\\overrightarrow{ZO}=d$. The lengths satisfy $LT:TZ=1:4$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{TO}$ in terms of $a$ and $d$. Fill in both coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{TO}=$ {{field-1}} $a+$ {{field-2}} $d$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "First express both endpoint vectors in the directions away from $O$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OL}=a\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OZ}=-d .\n$$\n\nTrace the path from $L$ through $O$ to $Z$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{LZ}=\\overrightarrow{LO}+\\overrightarrow{OZ}=-a-d.\n$$\n\nThe ratio $LT:TZ=1:4$ gives $5$ parts in the whole segment. Thus\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{LT}=\\frac{1}{5}\\overrightarrow{LZ}=\\frac{1}{5}(-a-d).\n$$\n\nAdd along the path $O\\to L\\to T$ and collect coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{OT}&=\\overrightarrow{OL}+\\overrightarrow{LT}\\\\&=a+\\frac{1}{5}(-a-d)\\\\&=\\frac{4}{5}a-\\frac{1}{5}d.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe requested vector has the reverse direction, so negate both coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{TO}=-\\overrightarrow{OT}=-\\frac{4}{5}a+\\frac{1}{5}d.\n$$",
